WEBVTT

00:08.777 --> 00:14.537
Let's laugh and cry.
chanto waraimasho, nakimasho

00:15.137 --> 00:20.727
Subs originally by Froth-Bite
Manually retyped by #Retrofit@IRC.Rizon.Net
Raws by Darkside-Raws
We need to fill up our hearts.
kokoro no nakami wo juujitsu sasenakuccha

00:20.767 --> 00:29.317
Making matching memories with you...
anata to osoroi no omoide tsukuruno ga

00:29.317 --> 00:31.187
...is important.
daiji daiji

00:32.467 --> 00:35.017
Sometimes I become...
sunao ni narenakattari

00:35.347 --> 00:38.847
...almost dishonest and mean
ijiwaru shichaisouna hi aruno

00:40.347 --> 00:41.687
That's because...
sore wa...

00:43.687 --> 00:46.437
I love you and adore you,
daisuki de taisetsu de

00:46.567 --> 00:49.777
and I don't want to be apart from you.
hanaretaku nai sei nano nante

00:51.737 --> 00:52.737
That's the truth.
henne

00:55.287 --> 01:01.997
I just want to cuddle...
hontou wa itsumo nuku nuku shitetai

01:02.327 --> 01:04.337
...with you.
futaride

01:05.337 --> 01:11.047
So let's laugh and cry.
dakara waraimashou, nakimashou

01:11.717 --> 01:17.137
We need to keep our hearts warm.
kokoro no ondo wo atatame awanakucha

01:17.347 --> 01:25.777
The fate that made us meet...
anata to deaeta unmei ho subetega

01:25.777 --> 01:27.477
...is important.
daiji daiji

01:34.547 --> 01:38.007
After the cricket pulled out the stopper,

01:38.847 --> 01:41.137
the water quickly drained.

01:42.057 --> 01:43.637
Princess Umeboshi!

01:43.637 --> 01:45.887
We're fine now!

01:45.887 --> 01:48.097
Thank you, everyone!

01:48.477 --> 01:50.107
Princess Umeboshi!

01:50.357 --> 01:51.897
Yes!

01:51.897 --> 01:56.027
Princess Umeboshi and everyone else were reunited again--

01:56.027 --> 01:59.657
everyone except for the one princess who remained asleep.

02:05.037 --> 02:05.867
Oh?

02:06.167 --> 02:07.537
Bara-san, are you alone?

02:08.207 --> 02:10.037
Where is everyone else?

02:10.627 --> 02:12.667
The Kurosakis are working...

02:12.667 --> 02:15.167
...and Shiratori took Nanako to her room.

02:16.587 --> 02:17.837
Oh.

02:17.837 --> 02:19.467
So it's Nanako-chan this time.

02:20.297 --> 02:21.507
What about Tama-chan?

02:21.887 --> 02:23.057
She has still...

02:23.717 --> 02:26.347
...locked herself in her room...

02:32.607 --> 02:35.647
<i>Wait for me, Kozue-chan.</i>

02:38.837 --> 02:42.357
The Night of Revelation

02:42.357 --> 02:42.847
Sakata-kun.
The Night of Revelation

02:42.847 --> 02:43.397
Sakata-kun.

02:43.397 --> 02:44.147
Here.

02:44.147 --> 02:45.147
Sasaki-kun.

02:45.147 --> 02:45.857
Here.

02:45.857 --> 02:46.947
Nakajima-san.

02:46.947 --> 02:47.357
Here.

02:47.947 --> 02:49.237
Shiratori-kun.

02:51.117 --> 02:52.037
Shiratori-kun?

02:52.487 --> 02:54.037
Shiratori Ryushi-kun?

02:55.037 --> 02:56.747
That's strange...

02:56.747 --> 03:00.537
Shiratori-kun, who's always so earnest, has skipped class two days in a row without notifying me.

03:00.537 --> 03:03.377
Did he catch a cold?

03:04.007 --> 03:08.377
Maybe he's wooing a beautiful woman!

03:08.387 --> 03:12.597
Or maybe he fell into a questionable relationship with a beautiful, young boy.

03:12.597 --> 03:13.057
Huh!?

03:13.347 --> 03:16.387
Damn Shiratori, how can
he do that without me!?
Oh Shiratori-kun, I can't
believe you did that!

03:16.387 --> 03:18.017
My, my.

03:18.017 --> 03:22.147
How long do you plan on chitchatting?

03:26.527 --> 03:28.607
I think I heard something...

03:28.607 --> 03:29.947
Hey, Shiratori!

03:30.867 --> 03:32.947
Don't just stand there.

03:32.947 --> 03:34.287
Right!

03:35.617 --> 03:39.667
Shiratori can do it, so why do I have to clean the courtyard?

03:39.667 --> 03:41.167
You ask why,

03:41.167 --> 03:43.287
but you started doing it first.

03:43.797 --> 03:44.797
<i>Oh, yeah.</i>

03:44.797 --> 03:48.627
<i>She started doing it when she was Nanako-chan because she wanted to do something to help.</i>

03:48.627 --> 03:49.797
Um, Saki-chan...

03:50.137 --> 03:52.347
Did I really?

03:52.347 --> 03:54.137
Well, I guess I could have...

03:54.137 --> 03:55.217
Um...

03:55.217 --> 03:56.887
Damn, this is annoying!

03:56.887 --> 03:58.727
So we'll finish it quickly, Shiratori!

03:58.727 --> 04:00.307
Hey!

04:00.307 --> 04:02.187
We just made that pile!

04:02.187 --> 04:02.897
Don't worry about minor details!
We just made that pile!

04:02.897 --> 04:04.727
Don't worry about minor details!

04:08.197 --> 04:10.907
The cleaning isn't going anywhere without Kozue.

04:10.907 --> 04:12.617
I know.

04:13.577 --> 04:15.827
So, let's try something.

04:16.327 --> 04:18.327
Bara-san, can I use that for a bit?

04:18.327 --> 04:19.867
What are you going to do?

04:22.247 --> 04:23.207
Jeez!

04:23.207 --> 04:25.497
There's no end to this!

04:27.707 --> 04:29.417
A butterfly!

04:29.677 --> 04:31.927
This toy works pretty well.

04:31.927 --> 04:32.927
Me too.

04:32.927 --> 04:34.387
I want to do it too.

04:35.887 --> 04:36.137
Good.

04:36.137 --> 04:36.677
Saki-chan!
Good.

04:36.677 --> 04:36.767
Saki-chan!

04:36.767 --> 04:37.267
Now, it'll be all fine and dandy if she turns back into Kozue-chan...
Saki-chan!

04:37.267 --> 04:40.767
Now, it'll be all fine and dandy if she turns back into Kozue-chan...

04:41.227 --> 04:42.767
Are you okay!?

04:47.317 --> 04:49.147
I'm okay...

04:50.737 --> 04:51.737
...maybe.

04:52.987 --> 04:53.657
Maybe?

04:55.367 --> 04:57.197
Natsume-chan?

04:57.947 --> 04:58.867
Maybe.

05:00.907 --> 05:02.617
It didn't work.

05:04.667 --> 05:07.207
<i>Momono-san, that's so reckless.</i>

05:07.207 --> 05:08.497
You're cleaning?

05:09.837 --> 05:11.507
Yeah, I am.

05:11.507 --> 05:14.177
Can I help?

05:15.007 --> 05:19.467
I like cleaning... maybe.

05:19.467 --> 05:20.267
Really?

05:20.267 --> 05:21.807
That would help me out a lot, Natsume-chan!

05:25.807 --> 05:27.727
<i>But I just swept there.</i>

05:28.107 --> 05:30.187
It doesn't work...

05:30.187 --> 05:32.147
Well, she is better at it than Saki.

05:32.697 --> 05:34.987
Sayo-chan, we're already done with that.

05:35.487 --> 05:37.447
I feel a big one coming soon.

05:42.157 --> 05:43.077
Oh?

05:43.077 --> 05:45.497
What are you doing, Momono-san!?

05:45.497 --> 05:46.787
It wasn't me!

05:46.787 --> 05:47.837
It was Sayo-chan...

05:50.297 --> 05:51.547
Natsume-chan!

05:51.547 --> 05:53.337
Jeez, what are we going to do now, Momono-san...

05:53.337 --> 05:53.797
Oh, dear Lord!
Jeez, what are we going to do now, Momono-san...

05:53.797 --> 05:55.587
Oh, dear Lord!

05:55.927 --> 06:01.137
How could I dress so inappropriately to come out into the yard!?

06:01.137 --> 06:03.597
I must change into the correct attire right away!

06:12.937 --> 06:14.697
It's a man!

06:17.777 --> 06:18.527
Chiyuri-chan!

06:18.527 --> 06:19.277
Don't get near me!

06:19.277 --> 06:20.517
Wait! Wait!

06:20.517 --> 06:20.527
You filthy man!
Wait! Wait!

06:20.527 --> 06:24.457
You filthy man!

06:24.997 --> 06:29.087
It just doesn't feel right without Kozue-chan.

06:29.087 --> 06:31.417
Or without Tama-chan.

06:37.717 --> 06:39.637
Let's eat!

06:41.347 --> 06:45.267
A snack tastes really good after working!

06:45.267 --> 06:45.557
Yeah.

06:46.187 --> 06:49.557
But I did most of the work.

06:49.557 --> 06:53.567
Don't worry about minor details, Shiratori.

06:53.897 --> 06:55.687
S-Saki-chan...

06:55.697 --> 06:56.857
That's right.

06:56.857 --> 07:00.157
I went out to buy these taiyaki.

07:00.157 --> 07:01.697
Aren't they good?

07:01.697 --> 07:03.157
Yummy.

07:03.157 --> 07:04.787
How many are you eating?

07:05.497 --> 07:07.457
This one is for Asami.

07:07.457 --> 07:09.787
We already saved some for Asami.

07:13.337 --> 07:14.377
You're eating them!?

07:14.877 --> 07:16.917
Hey, I found something good over here.

07:17.717 --> 07:21.427
I got tired of eating only sweets.

07:26.017 --> 07:27.517
So good!

07:28.477 --> 07:30.847
This is the best umeboshi I've ever had!

07:30.857 --> 07:33.227
It's not too salty and it has just enough perilla.

07:33.817 --> 07:36.397
Who made such delicious umeboshi?

07:38.737 --> 07:39.407
What's wrong?

07:40.567 --> 07:41.527
Well...

07:45.867 --> 07:46.907
<i>Kozue-chan?</i>

07:47.537 --> 07:48.657
<i>Shiratori-san!</i>

07:49.037 --> 07:50.287
<i>What are you doing?</i>

07:50.287 --> 07:52.247
<i>I'm letting them bask in the summer sun.</i>

07:52.247 --> 07:53.417
<i>Summer sun?</i>

07:53.417 --> 07:57.667
<i>I let the umeboshi bask in the sun so they get even more delicious.</i>

07:59.007 --> 08:01.587
<i>Come fall, they will be very delicious.</i>

08:02.297 --> 08:06.467
<i>When that time comes, let's enjoy them together.</i>

08:06.467 --> 08:10.597
The girl who made those has taken a leave of absence.

08:10.937 --> 08:12.187
A leave of absence?

08:12.187 --> 08:12.857
Yeah.

08:13.687 --> 08:16.027
Although, I think she'll be back soon.

08:18.027 --> 08:20.987
Then I'll save them until she comes back.

08:22.067 --> 08:26.537
It's too cruel for her to lose something important to her while she's not around.

08:26.537 --> 08:27.907
Saki-chan...

08:27.907 --> 08:31.917
Besides, we have to eat these things with one another.

08:33.207 --> 08:35.917
When that time comes, let's enjoy them together.

08:36.377 --> 08:38.087
Yes, that's right.

08:39.917 --> 08:41.467
I'm home!

08:41.467 --> 08:43.927
So, Mom, how is the work coming...

08:45.307 --> 08:48.177
Maybe you didn't do anything at all?

08:48.727 --> 08:49.807
Forgive me.

08:51.267 --> 08:54.307
Jeez. Fine, Mom.

08:54.307 --> 08:56.227
Don't let yourself get down so much.

08:56.777 --> 08:58.817
I'll help you out.

08:58.817 --> 09:00.107
You will?

09:00.107 --> 09:01.107
Thanks, but it's okay!

09:01.107 --> 09:02.607
I don't want to bother you!

09:02.607 --> 09:04.197
Don't be shy!

09:04.197 --> 09:05.947
I'll finish it quickly.

09:08.157 --> 09:10.077
Asami, work hard.

09:10.617 --> 09:11.707
You're coming too!

09:13.077 --> 09:17.207
Since I'm helping you, just sit back, relax, and enjoy!

09:19.547 --> 09:22.217
Well, I'll go help them out too.

09:22.217 --> 09:25.087
Saki-chan is as spectacular as always.

09:25.097 --> 09:28.637
But that's one of Kozue's personalities.

09:29.637 --> 09:30.517
Haibara-san...

09:34.437 --> 09:36.857
Ever since the day her parents had the accident,

09:36.857 --> 09:38.767
instead of crying,

09:38.777 --> 09:40.527
she'd laugh or get extremely mad,

09:41.687 --> 09:45.357
or she'd go into her own little world and refuse to deal with other people,

09:47.737 --> 09:50.827
or forget she was mourning and wear something fashionable instead,

09:51.407 --> 09:54.037
or she'd go back to her happy childhood.

09:59.417 --> 10:04.587
They are all "Kozues" she wanted to become and so they speak on her behalf.

10:05.547 --> 10:07.007
They're her other selves.

10:08.047 --> 10:10.557
She could make it this far...

10:10.557 --> 10:15.727
...because she had those other selves to help her overcome her sorrow from losing those dear to her.

10:16.897 --> 10:19.477
But this last time must have shocked her very badly.

10:21.147 --> 10:25.147
She is scared of losing someone again and so she won't come out.

10:26.657 --> 10:27.777
Does that mean...

10:27.777 --> 10:32.197
You meant that much to Kozue.

10:32.787 --> 10:34.157
No!

10:34.157 --> 10:35.957
Then what can we do!?

10:35.957 --> 10:36.917
I don't know.

10:37.917 --> 10:41.167
But we can only do what we can do.

10:41.747 --> 10:43.667
What we can do?

10:44.007 --> 10:45.547
Just like we have until today,

10:45.547 --> 10:49.757
we all do all we can for Kozue.

10:49.757 --> 10:54.727
Well, that is all we can do.

10:56.137 --> 10:58.847
For Kozue-chan...

11:05.987 --> 11:08.067
<i>I'm so worthless.</i>

11:08.067 --> 11:11.237
<i>I can't even figure out how to turn Kozue-chan back to normal.</i>

11:14.407 --> 11:15.697
Onii-chan! Onii-chan!

11:15.997 --> 11:16.707
Here!

11:16.707 --> 11:18.457
Look, look!

11:18.457 --> 11:21.207
Wow, that's pretty, Nanako-chan.

11:22.457 --> 11:24.297
Asa-chan gave me one.

11:24.587 --> 11:27.087
They wanted to thank me for helping.

11:27.087 --> 11:28.797
I see.

11:28.797 --> 11:29.717
Does it look good?

11:29.717 --> 11:31.427
Yes, it does.

11:32.807 --> 11:35.887
It's a big early, but it's my birthday present.

11:35.887 --> 11:38.477
I have a birthday soon!

11:38.477 --> 11:40.187
<i>I see.</i>

11:40.187 --> 11:44.227
<i>Kozue-chan's birthday is the same as Nanako-chan's and the others.</i>

11:44.227 --> 11:45.317
Hey, Onii-chan!

11:46.397 --> 11:50.487
Do you think I can become a big girl on my birthday?

11:50.487 --> 11:51.487
A big girl?

11:51.487 --> 11:52.447
Yeah!

11:52.447 --> 11:57.657
Like good at cooking, cleaning, and laundry,

11:57.657 --> 12:01.957
and a very kind girl!

12:01.957 --> 12:04.287
A very kind girl?

12:04.297 --> 12:04.747
Yeah!

12:05.127 --> 12:06.507
That's...

12:06.507 --> 12:07.797
Do you think I can?

12:08.967 --> 12:12.757
Can I become such a good girl?

12:13.847 --> 12:15.557
Yes, you can!

12:15.557 --> 12:16.217
Really?

12:16.217 --> 12:17.307
Yay!

12:17.387 --> 12:17.887
Yay!

12:18.017 --> 12:18.517
Yay!

12:18.637 --> 12:19.097
Yay!

12:19.187 --> 12:19.977
Yay!

12:20.057 --> 12:20.397
Yay!

12:20.397 --> 12:20.787
Nanako-chan
Yay!

12:20.787 --> 12:21.687
Nanako-chan

12:23.147 --> 12:24.477
Tama-chan.

12:24.817 --> 12:28.527
Momo-san was looking for you earlier.

12:28.527 --> 12:30.027
She way?

12:30.027 --> 12:33.907
I think she wanted some help with dinner.

12:33.907 --> 12:35.277
Yay!

12:35.277 --> 12:36.867
I love helping!

12:36.867 --> 12:37.497
Yay! Momo-chan!

12:37.497 --> 12:38.997
Then I'll go too.
Yay! Momo-chan!

12:41.327 --> 12:43.917
I need to talk to you.

12:43.917 --> 12:44.707
Talk?

12:45.167 --> 12:46.247
Yes,

12:46.247 --> 12:47.167
we need to have a very...

12:48.797 --> 12:50.717
...important conversation.

12:51.967 --> 12:53.717
Tamami...chan?

13:05.607 --> 13:06.817
Shiratori-san,

13:07.567 --> 13:10.317
how long are you planning to stay here?

13:10.857 --> 13:12.357
How long?

13:12.907 --> 13:17.027
I have been with Kozue-chan ever since we met.

13:17.907 --> 13:19.867
Since the day of that accident...

13:19.867 --> 13:22.247
Since Kozue-chan started transforming...

13:22.497 --> 13:27.877
I've done everything I could to keep it a secret.

13:27.877 --> 13:29.547
I, uh, see.

13:29.547 --> 13:32.467
<i>I'm sure you've done absolutely everything you could.</i>

13:33.797 --> 13:36.967
I had the ability to do it,

13:37.557 --> 13:38.387
and moreover,

13:40.347 --> 13:43.057
Kozue-chan was everything to me.

13:44.727 --> 13:45.807
That's why...

13:46.227 --> 13:48.057
That's why I...

13:49.357 --> 13:51.357
I detest you.

13:53.607 --> 13:54.277
Um...

13:54.277 --> 13:55.197
I...

13:55.777 --> 13:57.067
I...

13:59.577 --> 14:01.407
I adore Kozue-chan.

14:01.947 --> 14:04.327
I love Kozue-chan...

14:05.287 --> 14:06.327
...more than anyone else,

14:07.207 --> 14:08.667
above everthing else,

14:09.167 --> 14:10.667
I love her!

14:10.877 --> 14:16.427
But you, after only being here for a few months, entered her heart.

14:16.427 --> 14:18.677
I despise you for that!

14:20.677 --> 14:21.927
Tamami-chan...

14:22.597 --> 14:24.637
I will save Kozue-chan.

14:24.637 --> 14:27.307
I will find a way.

14:27.307 --> 14:30.067
I will do anything.

14:30.067 --> 14:32.397
I will even sacrifice my life.

14:32.397 --> 14:35.197
That is my resolution!

14:35.197 --> 14:37.607
In other words, if you are not prepared to make such a sacrifice,

14:37.617 --> 14:41.947
or love her as much as I do, you are not allowed to touch Kozue-chan's heart!

14:42.657 --> 14:45.867
Can you say that you have that much love or have made that resolution?

14:47.167 --> 14:47.917
I can.

14:51.047 --> 14:53.917
I don't know if this is love or not.

14:53.917 --> 14:55.047
But I'm ready.

14:55.927 --> 14:58.427
I want Kozue-chan to be happy too.

14:59.137 --> 15:02.467
No matter how much trouble I have to go through for Kozue-chan, I will not mind.

15:03.177 --> 15:06.097
I don't know if I can save her or not.

15:06.097 --> 15:11.397
But even then, I want to stay by Kozue-chan's side and help her.

15:13.397 --> 15:16.277
Then you can do it?

15:16.277 --> 15:18.907
You can do everything to make Kozue-chan happy,

15:18.907 --> 15:20.987
even if it means that you make yourself or others unhappy?

15:22.537 --> 15:26.037
Everyone else doesn't mention it, but they all should know by now!

15:26.037 --> 15:28.537
For Kozue-chan to be Kozue-chan,

15:28.537 --> 15:34.797
we have to have Saki-chan, Nanako-chan, Chiyuri-chan, and Natsume-chan disappear.

15:34.797 --> 15:35.797
No way!

15:36.337 --> 15:37.667
Don't tell me "no way"!

15:38.337 --> 15:40.507
I don't want that either.

15:40.507 --> 15:42.757
But we can't help it.

15:42.757 --> 15:48.517
If it's for the good of Kozue-chan, we have to do it.

15:52.017 --> 15:52.727
But...

15:54.067 --> 15:56.727
I don't think that's what Kozue-chan wants.

15:58.107 --> 16:01.237
It's been less than a year since I came to Narutakisou,

16:01.737 --> 16:06.237
but I know what makes Kozue-chan smile.

16:07.537 --> 16:09.497
Kozue-chan always...

16:10.877 --> 16:14.037
...smiles...

16:14.037 --> 16:16.587
...when she's having a good time with others,

16:16.587 --> 16:18.967
and when she sees that other people are happy.

16:20.967 --> 16:27.927
So I don't think she wants to see you looking so sad, Tamami-chan.

16:29.347 --> 16:32.307
Kozue-chan would definitely not want that.

16:34.267 --> 16:36.647
Kozue-chan... would...

16:38.647 --> 16:40.237
Don't say things you don't mean.

16:43.407 --> 16:48.537
Kozue-chan can't come back because of you!

16:48.537 --> 16:49.327
Well, that's...

16:49.787 --> 16:52.597
Then what do you intend to do for Kozue-chan!?

16:52.597 --> 16:55.587
What can you do for her!?

16:57.837 --> 16:58.917
I don't know.

17:01.337 --> 17:02.627
You don't know?

17:02.637 --> 17:03.837
How irresponsible!

17:03.837 --> 17:04.717
But...

17:05.717 --> 17:08.387
Even though I don't know what I can do,

17:08.387 --> 17:12.937
the only thing I want to do is make her happy.

17:12.937 --> 17:16.557
I don't want her to suffer anymore.

17:16.567 --> 17:18.937
So I will not make any sacrifices,

17:18.937 --> 17:20.777
and I don't think anyone else should either.

17:21.147 --> 17:25.317
I want everyone precious to me to keep on smiling forever.

17:25.987 --> 17:30.747
But I still don't know exactly what I should be doing.

17:30.747 --> 17:33.667
So why don't we think together...

17:34.287 --> 17:36.877
...about how we can make Kozue-chan smile?

17:37.627 --> 17:38.877
OK, Tamami-chan?

17:38.877 --> 17:39.877
<i>That's right.</i>

17:40.457 --> 17:42.417
<i>He really does care about Kozue-chan.</i>

17:42.417 --> 17:47.097
<i>He doesn't think about how he can prepare or sacrifice himself.</i>

17:47.097 --> 17:51.347
<i>His feelings are more genuine and sincere.</i>

17:52.517 --> 17:55.897
<i>And... Kozue-chan too...</i>

18:01.857 --> 18:02.817
Tamami-chan?

18:04.107 --> 18:05.067
Are you okay?

18:08.197 --> 18:11.407
Oh, my, what's wrong with you?

18:11.407 --> 18:17.167
Do you really think a weakling like you can support Kozue-chan?

18:17.167 --> 18:18.667
Let me...

18:24.087 --> 18:29.887
If you really do know Kozue-chan that well, I need you to be a bit stronger.

18:31.347 --> 18:33.517
Or else I won't forgive you.

18:34.477 --> 18:36.977
Now, I'm counting on you.

18:42.647 --> 18:43.687
Tamami-chan...

18:47.737 --> 18:50.487
I'm a big girl...

18:54.327 --> 18:57.367
She finally went to sleep.

18:57.367 --> 19:01.837
Sheesh, why would she lie and say that I was looking for her?

19:01.837 --> 19:04.917
Damn Tama, I won't go easy on her when I find her...

19:05.467 --> 19:06.127
Oh?

19:07.217 --> 19:08.507
Tama-chan?

19:09.007 --> 19:11.137
Why are you sulking in here?

19:12.427 --> 19:13.677
Did something happen?

19:15.017 --> 19:18.807
I lost to Shiratori-san.

19:20.057 --> 19:21.687
I'm worthless.

19:22.517 --> 19:27.237
I always said I did it "for Kozue-chan," but I really only cared about myself.

19:27.737 --> 19:30.407
I wanted to stay by Kozue-chan's side.

19:30.407 --> 19:32.777
I wanted to hog Kozue-chan all to myself.

19:33.327 --> 19:38.247
I know how Kozue-chan felt, but I didn't want to admit it.

19:38.247 --> 19:40.667
And then I said I'd support her.

19:41.127 --> 19:44.247
There is no way I can win against Shiratori-san with him being how he is.

19:44.837 --> 19:48.667
No, the result was clear from the beginning.

19:48.677 --> 19:52.257
But I looked away from the harsh reality.

19:53.217 --> 19:57.057
I'm so worthless.

20:02.227 --> 20:03.357
Don't push yourself.

20:03.817 --> 20:07.397
It's okay to cry when you feel like that.

20:34.597 --> 20:38.347
<i>Something that will make Kozue-chan happy...</i>

20:39.597 --> 20:42.137
<i>What can you do to make Kozue-chan happy!?</i>

20:42.727 --> 20:45.057
<i>But we can only do what we can do.</i>

20:46.687 --> 20:49.987
What I can do?

21:03.077 --> 21:04.327
<i>Really?</i>

21:05.247 --> 21:09.047
<i>You are working to make your dreams come true!</i>

21:10.047 --> 21:13.377
<i>It makes me feel all warm inside.</i>

21:13.837 --> 21:15.587
<i>Your drawings have always been filled with such warmth.</i>

21:24.397 --> 21:25.347
All right!

21:28.857 --> 21:30.937
<i>What I can do...</i>

21:30.937 --> 21:34.777
<i>What makes Kozue-chan and the others happy...</i>

21:38.157 --> 21:39.867
<i>This is about all...</i>

21:42.037 --> 21:43.287
<i>...I can do for now.</i>

21:56.307 --> 22:02.817
One day, I drew a picture all over a canvas,
itsu no hika canvas ni e ippai

22:02.897 --> 22:08.617
a picture of 7-colored dreams.
nanairo no yume egaita

22:10.037 --> 22:16.497
When I noticed, I was a bit more grown up.
ki ga tsukeba sukoshi otona ni natte

22:16.747 --> 22:21.797
What have I found?
nani wo mitsuketandarou

22:23.757 --> 22:30.507
In this aimless daily life,
yuka ate no nai mainichi no nakade

22:30.757 --> 22:36.437
I found something that's most important.
ichiban taisetsuna koto ni kizuita

22:37.437 --> 22:43.277
Yes, it's always all right,
donna tokidemo sousa daijoubu

22:43.277 --> 22:45.527
because you are here.
kimi ga irukara

22:45.737 --> 22:51.907
Holding these unforgettable thoughts,
wasurenai kono omoi dakishimete

22:52.407 --> 22:58.247
I will start walking the path of the halted fantasy again,
mouichido togireta yume no fantasy

22:58.247 --> 23:02.877
at my own speed.
aruitemiyou boku no speed de

